#: ../../source/docs/apms-failsafe-function.rst:5
#: 07daf63f349a4484a38813f1143fb196
msgid "Plane Failsafe Function"
msgstr "Plane 失控保护功能"

#: ../../source/docs/apms-failsafe-function.rst:7
#: 6415dc34f8444542886c47ec2c0eff59
msgid ""
"Plane has a limited failsafe function which is designed to do four things:"
msgstr "Plane 具有有限的失控保护功能，设计用于完成四项任务："

#: ../../source/docs/apms-failsafe-function.rst:10
#: 54cf7ef14db649b39720f3e308794ad4
msgid ""
"Detects a RC Failsafe condition and then initiating a defined response, such"
" as returning to home. Detection of an RC Failsafe is either a complete "
"loss, or corruption, of RC signals, or the receiver sets a FS bit in its "
"data stream for those protocols supporting it (SBUS, etc.), or that the "
"throttle channel PWM value falls below a certain point set by "
":ref:`THR_FS_VALUE<THR_FS_VALUE>`. This RC failsafe must be enabled by "
"setting :ref:`THR_FAILSAFE<THR_FAILSAFE>` = 1."
msgstr ""
"检测 RC 失控保护条件并启动预定义响应（例如返回 Home）。RC 失控保护的触发条件包括：RC 信号完全丢失或损坏，接收机在其支持的协议（SBUS "
"等）的数据流中设置了 FS 位，或油门通道 PWM 值低于 :ref:`THR_FS_VALUE<THR_FS_VALUE>` 设定的阈值。此 RC "
"失控保护必须通过设置 :ref:`THR_FAILSAFE<THR_FAILSAFE>` = 1 来启用。"

#: ../../source/docs/apms-failsafe-function.rst:11
#: 76c79868192f423d83be73b6a3b64e3c
msgid ""
"Optionally, detect loss of telemetry (GCS Failsafe) and take an programmable"
" action, such as switching to return to launch (RTL) mode."
msgstr "可选：检测数传丢失（GCS 失控保护）并执行可编程操作，例如切换到返回起飞点（RTL）模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/apms-failsafe-function.rst:13
#: 4be1de6abf5144e6a7cf4d3eb2dfec4a
msgid ""
"Either of the above have two phases: Short Failsafe which occurs a "
"programmable time after loss of RC or telemetry, which allows optionally "
"circling to try to recover the signals, and if the loss persists longer, a "
"Long Failsafe which determines what long term action is to be taken."
msgstr ""
"以上两种情况均有两个阶段：短时失控保护（在 RC "
"或数传丢失后经过可编程时间触发，可选择盘旋以尝试恢复信号），以及若丢失持续更长时间则触发的长时失控保护（确定要采取的长期措施）。"

#: ../../source/docs/apms-failsafe-function.rst:15
#: 1d8c232604d54c7a8f6c135fcdee7367
msgid ""
"Detect loss of GPS for more than 20 seconds and switch into Dead Reckoning "
"mode until GPS signal is regained. See https://youtu.be/0VMx2u8MlUU for a "
"demo."
msgstr ""
"检测 GPS 丢失超过 20 秒并切换到航位推算模式，直至重新获得 GPS 信号。演示视频请见 "
"https://youtu.be/0VMx2u8MlUU。"

#: ../../source/docs/apms-failsafe-function.rst:16
#: beff0d70277a4ac091757174304ab1d4
msgid ""
"Optionally, detect low battery conditions (low voltage/remaining capacity) "
"and initiate a programmable response, such as returning to home. ArduPilot "
"supports this on multiple batteries."
msgstr "可选：检测低电量状态（低电压/剩余容量不足）并启动可编程响应，例如返回 Home。ArduPilot 支持对多块电池进行此项检测。"

#: ../../source/docs/apms-failsafe-function.rst:18
#: c164fbb853fc438f8202fda33897e506
msgid "Here's what the failsafe **will not do**:"
msgstr "以下是失控保护**不能**执行的操作："

#: ../../source/docs/apms-failsafe-function.rst:20
#: c1849c154c1247ec8aa960088ba82abb
msgid ""
"Detect if one or more individual RC channel has failed or become "
"disconnected"
msgstr "检测单个或多个 RC 通道是否发生故障或断开连接"

#: ../../source/docs/apms-failsafe-function.rst:21
#: 2590412e029d4641b6e2e83eab3a1c1b
msgid "Detect if you're flying too far away or are about to hit the ground"
msgstr "检测飞行距离是否过远或是否即将撞地"

#: ../../source/docs/apms-failsafe-function.rst:22
#: 69610f8d750e46849535b078a86584aa
msgid ""
"Detect autopilot hardware failures, such as low-power brownouts or in-air "
"reboots"
msgstr "检测飞控硬件故障，例如低电量掉电或空中重启"

#: ../../source/docs/apms-failsafe-function.rst:23
#: 36744693524e4d71a7e67b581b88aebd
msgid "Detect if the Plane software is not operating correctly"
msgstr "检测 Plane 软件是否运行不正常"

#: ../../source/docs/apms-failsafe-function.rst:24
#: 211ecc461ab74a11830128bc6a78283f
msgid "Detect other problems with the aircraft, such as motor failures"
msgstr "检测飞机的其他故障，例如电机故障"

#: ../../source/docs/apms-failsafe-function.rst:25
#: 9bdbf8be9c4247a99b7bdd89b4a0685c
msgid "Otherwise stop you from making setup or flight mistakes"
msgstr "防止您犯设置或飞行错误"

#: ../../source/docs/apms-failsafe-function.rst:28
#: 5b320efd99cf4003a95f8f06b078b4c2
msgid ""
"See :ref:`advanced-failsafe-configuration` for extended failsafe "
"configurations."
msgstr "有关扩展失控保护配置，请参阅 :ref:`advanced-failsafe-configuration`。"

#: ../../source/docs/apms-failsafe-function.rst:32
#: db11b9470936407dab6399d4ac65b9e7
msgid "RC Failsafe"
msgstr "RC 失控保护"

#: ../../source/docs/apms-failsafe-function.rst:37
#: 22f61e393452477591b5166dbfbc19e1
msgid "Radio Signal Failure"
msgstr "无线电信号丢失"

#: ../../source/docs/apms-failsafe-function.rst:39
#: 83d5c8b161f1429b98f9eb9276ff14e4
msgid ""
"If the received signal is lost or the control information corrupted, or the "
"receiver sets its \"failsafe bit\" in protocols which have this (like Sbus, "
"FPort, etc.), or RC_OVERRIDES are lost if :ref:`using a GCS only <common-"
"gcs-only-operation>` is being used, then an RC Failsafe condition occurs and"
" the actions described in the :ref:`RC Failsafe Actions<fs_actions>` section"
" below will be taken, if the :ref:`THR_FAILSAFE<THR_FAILSAFE>` parameter is "
"1."
msgstr ""
"如果接收到的信号丢失、控制信息损坏，或接收机在支持此功能的协议（如 Sbus、FPort 等）中设置了「failsafe bit」，或者在使用 "
":ref:`仅 GCS 控制 <common-gcs-only-operation>` 时 RC_OVERRIDES 丢失，则会发生 RC "
"失控保护状态，若 :ref:`THR_FAILSAFE<THR_FAILSAFE>` 参数为 1，则将采取下文 :ref:`RC "
"失控保护动作<fs_actions>` 部分所述的措施。"

#: ../../source/docs/apms-failsafe-function.rst:41
#: 7b9ae00e45b44aa3953d3ff0698eab6a
msgid ""
"by setting :ref:`RC_OPTIONS<RC_OPTIONS>` bit 2, you can force ArduPilot to "
"ignore the \"failsafe\" bits in the protocol, and only initiate RC Failsafe "
"due to missing or corrupted control information."
msgstr ""
"通过设置 :ref:`RC_OPTIONS<RC_OPTIONS>` 的第 2 位，可以强制 ArduPilot "
"忽略协议中的「failsafe」位，仅在控制信息缺失或损坏时触发 RC 失控保护。"

#: ../../source/docs/apms-failsafe-function.rst:44
#: cfcf460f2ed8477386b0b813ade76292
msgid "Throttle Failsafe"
msgstr "油门失控保护"

#: ../../source/docs/apms-failsafe-function.rst:46
#: 81a8b169c6be4dfaaf3302f16853897a
msgid ""
"In addition, if the throttle signal falls below a threshold set by "
":ref:`THR_FS_VALUE<THR_FS_VALUE>` and the :ref:`THR_FAILSAFE<THR_FAILSAFE>` "
"is = 1, an RC Failsafe condition will be entered, a Ground Control Station "
"text message (\"Throttle Failsafe On\") will be sent (to differentiate from "
"a Radio Signal Failure Failsafe), and the actions described in the RC "
"Failsafe Actions section below will be taken."
msgstr ""
"此外，如果油门信号低于 :ref:`THR_FS_VALUE<THR_FS_VALUE>` 设定的阈值，且 "
":ref:`THR_FAILSAFE<THR_FAILSAFE>` = 1，则将进入 RC 失控保护状态，地面站将收到文字消息（「Throttle "
"Failsafe On」）以区别于无线电信号失控保护，同时将采取下文 RC 失控保护动作部分所述的措施。"

#: ../../source/docs/apms-failsafe-function.rst:49
#: 6009e803ca9643c6bf019afec22872c9
msgid "Throttle Failsafe Setup"
msgstr "油门失控保护设置"

#: ../../source/docs/apms-failsafe-function.rst:51
#: 4dee60166d884933b63fe5dc64d61dd3
msgid ""
"Throttle Failsafe is not required. If you wish to have failsafe protection "
"against RC signal loss, but not setup a throttle signal controlled failsafe,"
" then set :ref:`THR_FS_VALUE<THR_FS_VALUE>` lower than the lowest RC "
"throttle signal that can be sent to the autopilot from the receiver."
msgstr ""
"油门失控保护并非必须。如果希望对 RC 信号丢失进行失控保护，但不设置基于油门信号的失控保护，则将 "
":ref:`THR_FS_VALUE<THR_FS_VALUE>` 设为低于接收机能向飞控发送的最低 RC 油门信号值。"

#: ../../source/docs/apms-failsafe-function.rst:53
#: a3c1df812b3f423498040c9b13ce2043
msgid ""
"In order to activate the Throttle Failsafe, the throttle signal received by "
"the autopilot must be below :ref:`THR_FS_VALUE<THR_FS_VALUE>`. Once setup, "
"this can be controlled by the pilot to initiate Throttle failsafe "
"intentionally (for testing, or instead of setting up an RTL position on the "
"flight mode switch), or by having the receiver, itself, send that value when"
" it loses RC signal."
msgstr ""
"要激活油门失控保护，飞控接收到的油门信号必须低于 "
":ref:`THR_FS_VALUE<THR_FS_VALUE>`。设置完成后，飞手可以主动触发油门失控保护（用于测试，或代替在飞行模式开关上设置 "
"RTL 位置），也可以让接收机在失去 RC 信号时自动发送该值。"

#: ../../source/docs/apms-failsafe-function.rst:55
#: 05d3d9fdddea47eab9ee3992aea62372
msgid ""
"having the receiver send a pre-set failsafe throttle value upon signal loss "
"is NOT recommended and can lead to issues if a battery level failsafe is "
"setup in QuadPlanes. Setting the receiver to send \"no pulses\" is much "
"preferred. However, some very old receivers will only send a low throttle "
"level in failsafe, see the section below, :ref:`Old Receivers <old_RX>`."
msgstr ""
"不建议让接收机在信号丢失时发送预设的失控保护油门值，这可能导致在 QuadPlane "
"中设置电池失控保护时出现问题。强烈建议将接收机设置为发送「无脉冲」。但是，某些非常老旧的接收机在失控保护时只能发送低油门电平，请参阅下文 "
":ref:`旧接收机 <old_RX>` 部分。"

#: ../../source/docs/apms-failsafe-function.rst:57
#: 700219c630784a5aa4a20c606a52c16f
msgid ""
"The system must be setup such that the throttle channel's signal can go "
"below :ref:`THR_FS_VALUE<THR_FS_VALUE>` (Default is 950), but still be above"
" it for normal low throttle stick operation. Before doing the :ref:`RC "
"Calibration<common-radio-control-calibration>` setup step which determines "
"normal operating ranges for the throttle channel and others, make sure that "
"the low throttle stick position on your transmitter is above "
":ref:`THR_FS_VALUE<THR_FS_VALUE>`. This can be done several ways:"
msgstr ""
"系统必须设置为使油门通道信号可以降至 :ref:`THR_FS_VALUE<THR_FS_VALUE>`（默认值为 "
"950）以下，但在正常低油门摇杆操作时仍须高于该值。在进行 :ref:`RC 校准<common-radio-control-calibration>`"
" 步骤（该步骤确定油门通道及其他通道的正常操作范围）之前，请确认遥控器上的低油门摇杆位置高于 "
":ref:`THR_FS_VALUE<THR_FS_VALUE>`。可通过以下几种方法实现："

#: ../../source/docs/apms-failsafe-function.rst:59
#: 8a13db0297b1408bb51e2964c30fdeef
msgid ""
"When you do the :ref:`RC Calibration <common-radio-control-calibration>` "
"setup step, change the trim tab for the throttle channel to adjust its "
"signal 40-50us above :ref:`THR_FS_VALUE<THR_FS_VALUE>` at low throttle "
"stick. This will be the normal operating position. Lowering the trim tab and"
" setting the :ref:`THR_FS_VALUE<THR_FS_VALUE>` to that value allows "
"initiating a failsafe at low trim."
msgstr ""
"在进行 :ref:`RC 校准 <common-radio-control-calibration>` "
"步骤时，调整油门通道的微调片，使低油门摇杆位置时的信号比 :ref:`THR_FS_VALUE<THR_FS_VALUE>` 高 "
"40-50us。这将作为正常操作位置。降低微调片并将 :ref:`THR_FS_VALUE<THR_FS_VALUE>` "
"设为该值，可在低微调时触发失控保护。"

#: ../../source/docs/apms-failsafe-function.rst:60
#: a6179fc57b994d9b8f922f869c81e0f6
msgid ""
"Setup a transmitter switch that you will use to force failsafe such that it "
"forces the throttle channel signal, using a mix, to below "
":ref:`THR_FS_VALUE<THR_FS_VALUE>` when activated, allowing normal operation "
"otherwise."
msgstr ""
"设置一个遥控器开关，通过混控将油门通道信号强制降至 :ref:`THR_FS_VALUE<THR_FS_VALUE>` "
"以下来激活失控保护，平时允许正常操作。"

#: ../../source/docs/apms-failsafe-function.rst:65
#: aa1f1922ca9449969ed26cb892fb804c
msgid "RC Failsafe Operation"
msgstr "RC 失控保护操作"

#: ../../source/docs/apms-failsafe-function.rst:67
#: 1d8881af3e4e42f09e29d51f512a0466
msgid ""
"When RC Failsafe is entered, all RC inputs (except throttle in the case of "
"Throttle Failsafe), are ignored as the autopilot takes its failsafe actions."
msgstr "进入 RC 失控保护后，飞控执行失控保护动作期间，所有 RC 输入（油门失控保护情况下除油门通道外）均被忽略。"

#: ../../source/docs/apms-failsafe-function.rst:68
#: 6d02fa68d98440ec9903e4269d64d861
msgid ""
"First, the autopilot will go into Short Failsafe when it detects RC Failsafe"
" for more than ``FS_SHORT_TIMEOUT`` seconds."
msgstr "首先，当飞控检测到 RC 失控保护持续超过 ``FS_SHORT_TIMEOUT`` 秒时，将进入短失控保护。"

#: ../../source/docs/apms-failsafe-function.rst:69
#: e14c63153355410fbb880abc6a14d35e
msgid ""
"A message will be displayed on your Ground Control Station(GCS), or OSD, if "
"its message panel is enabled, that a Short Failsafe is active, and the "
"autopilot will take the :ref:`FS_SHORT_ACTN<FS_SHORT_ACTN>`, if enabled.  "
"The default is CIRCLE mode. This is intended to possibly allow the vehicle's"
" changing orientation to re-acquire the signal, but other actions can be "
"assigned. See :ref:`FS_SHORT_ACTN parameter below <failsafe-parameters>` for"
" how each mode responds to the selected action value."
msgstr ""
"地面站（GCS）或 OSD（如启用消息面板）上将显示短失控保护已激活的消息，飞控将执行 "
":ref:`FS_SHORT_ACTN<FS_SHORT_ACTN>`（若已启用）。默认为 CIRCLE "
"模式。其目的是通过改变飞行器朝向来尝试重新获取信号，但也可以指定其他动作。请参阅下文 :ref:`FS_SHORT_ACTN 参数 <failsafe-"
"parameters>`，了解各模式对所选动作值的响应方式。"

#: ../../source/docs/apms-failsafe-function.rst:70
#: 179d5362ef154f6ca32522c0c1be57f4
msgid ""
"If the condition causing the Short Failsafe is removed, the vehicle will "
"return to the previous mode, and a message will be displayed that Short "
"Failsafe is cleared. If it was a Throttle Failsafe that caused the RC "
"Failsafe, and throttle was increased in order to exit, then an additional "
"message will be sent stating that the Throttle Failsafe is OFF."
msgstr ""
"如果导致短失控保护的条件消除，飞行器将返回之前的模式，并显示短失控保护已解除的消息。如果是油门失控保护导致 RC "
"失控保护，且通过增加油门退出，则还将发送一条消息说明油门失控保护已关闭。"

#: ../../source/docs/apms-failsafe-function.rst:71
#: 34c8da4ffe734296867347b2153629fc
msgid ""
"If the condition causing the Short Failsafe persists longer than "
":ref:`FS_LONG_TIMEOUT<FS_LONG_TIMEOUT>` seconds the autopilot will go into "
"Long Failsafe, send a message to the GCS that it has been entered, and "
"execute the :ref:`FS_LONG_ACTN<FS_LONG_ACTN>` action, if enabled. The "
"default setting for Long Failsafe action to take is RTL (Return to Launch). "
"See :ref:`FS_LONG_ACTN parameter below <failsafe-parameters>` for how each "
"mode responds to the selected action value."
msgstr ""
"如果导致短失控保护的条件持续超过 :ref:`FS_LONG_TIMEOUT<FS_LONG_TIMEOUT>` 秒，飞控将进入长失控保护，向 GCS "
"发送消息，并执行 :ref:`FS_LONG_ACTN<FS_LONG_ACTN>` 动作（若已启用）。长失控保护的默认动作为 "
"RTL（返回起飞点）。请参阅下文 :ref:`FS_LONG_ACTN 参数 <failsafe-"
"parameters>`，了解各模式对所选动作值的响应方式。"

#: ../../source/docs/apms-failsafe-function.rst:72
#: a00bf13c1e9140969b6e6d6dbd7a10d7
msgid ""
"If the RC Failsafe condition is later exited, a message will be displayed "
"that the Long Failsafe is cleared, but the flight mode will not revert. If "
"it was a Throttle Failsafe that caused the RC Failsafe, and throttle was "
"increased in order to exit, then an additional message will be sent stating "
"that the Throttle Failsafe is OFF."
msgstr ""
"如果随后退出 RC 失控保护状态，将显示长失控保护已解除的消息，但飞行模式不会恢复。如果是油门失控保护导致 RC "
"失控保护，且通过增加油门退出，则还将发送一条消息说明油门失控保护已关闭。"

#: ../../source/docs/apms-failsafe-function.rst:74
#: 5e09560b4c764d59927f1f8290232b3a
msgid ""
"The action set by :ref:`FS_LONG_ACTN<FS_LONG_ACTN>` will continue even if "
"your RC signal is reacquired, if the flight mode is the same as it was "
"before the failsafe action began. Once RC signal is reacquired, the "
":ref:`FS_LONG_ACTN<FS_LONG_ACTN>` can be exited via a mode change on the "
":ref:`FLTMODE_CH<FLTMODE_CH>`. If the mode on the RC transmitter was changed"
" during the failsafe period, then this changed mode is entered after the RC "
"signal is restored. In addition, other failsafes, such as battery failsafe, "
"can also change the mode, if they occur subsequently to the RC signal loss."
msgstr ""
":ref:`FS_LONG_ACTN<FS_LONG_ACTN>` 设定的动作将持续执行，即使 RC "
"信号恢复，只要飞行模式与失控保护动作开始前相同。RC 信号恢复后，可通过在 :ref:`FLTMODE_CH<FLTMODE_CH>` 上切换模式退出 "
":ref:`FS_LONG_ACTN<FS_LONG_ACTN>`。若失控保护期间 RC 遥控器上的模式已更改，则 RC "
"信号恢复后将进入该更改后的模式。此外，其他失控保护（例如电池失控保护）若在 RC 信号丢失后触发，也可能改变飞行模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/apms-failsafe-function.rst:77
#: 40fb0cdd4319400984bb0c94439b903d
msgid "Bench Testing RC Failsafe"
msgstr "桌面测试 RC 失控保护"

#: ../../source/docs/apms-failsafe-function.rst:79
#: 0142e78c1b4040f59c688ae3586f8354
msgid ""
"Power up the system and verify that you are seeing RC control in the Mission"
" Planner SETUP->Mandatory Hardware->Radio Calibration tab and in a non-auto "
"mode (Manual, Stabilize, FBW are ok). Check that normal throttle movements "
"to idle do NOT trigger a failsafe and normal control stick movements are "
"observed."
msgstr ""
"给系统上电，确认在 Mission Planner 的 SETUP->Mandatory Hardware->Radio Calibration "
"选项卡中能看到 RC 控制，并处于非自动模式（Manual、Stabilize、FBW "
"均可）。检查正常油门移至怠速位置时不会触发失控保护，且能观察到正常的操控摇杆响应。"

#: ../../source/docs/apms-failsafe-function.rst:80
#: 3593757e65694850a06959337822a131
msgid ""
"Switch to Mission Planners DATA View tab. Turn off the transmitter. After "
"``FS_SHORT_TIMEOUT`` seconds, if enabled, you should see the flight mode "
"switch to :ref:`FS_SHORT_ACTN<FS_SHORT_ACTN>`. After "
":ref:`FS_LONG_TIMEOUT<FS_LONG_TIMEOUT>` sec, if enabled, the flight mode "
"should then switch to :ref:`FS_LONG_ACTN<FS_LONG_ACTN>`. Turn the "
"transmitter back on and change flight modes. The Long Failsafe flight mode "
"should change to the selected mode."
msgstr ""
"切换到 Mission Planner 的 DATA 视图选项卡。关闭遥控器。经过 ``FS_SHORT_TIMEOUT`` "
"秒后（若已启用），应看到飞行模式切换为 :ref:`FS_SHORT_ACTN<FS_SHORT_ACTN>`。再经过 "
":ref:`FS_LONG_TIMEOUT<FS_LONG_TIMEOUT>` 秒后（若已启用），飞行模式应切换为 "
":ref:`FS_LONG_ACTN<FS_LONG_ACTN>`。重新打开遥控器并切换飞行模式，长失控保护飞行模式应更改为所选模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/apms-failsafe-function.rst:81
#: dee889983f5642aeb0d4523a2f8ed6ff
msgid ""
"If Throttle Failsafe is setup (ie via trim tab or transmitter switch). Check"
" that it operates correctly by activating it and watching for Short and Long"
" Failsafes to occur."
msgstr "如果已设置油门失控保护（例如通过微调片或遥控器开关），通过激活并观察短失控保护和长失控保护是否正常触发来验证其是否正常工作。"

#: ../../source/docs/apms-failsafe-function.rst:83
#: 6fc2e1a4ea8a4740aadf675ecf6d7be3
msgid ""
"If you observe this behavior, your RC Failsafe function has been set up "
"correctly. If not, recheck that the parameters above have been set "
"correctly."
msgstr "如果观察到上述行为，则说明 RC 失控保护功能已正确设置。否则，请重新检查上述参数是否设置正确。"

#: ../../source/docs/apms-failsafe-function.rst:88
#: ea3de3fd80724a69aa7e8ddc5f60873b
msgid "Older Receivers"
msgstr "旧款接收机"

#: ../../source/docs/apms-failsafe-function.rst:90
#: 5714311619854823aeae0511664bfbc4
msgid ""
"Some very old RC receivers cannot be set to send \"no pulses\" when losing "
"RC signal and simple hold the ROLL/PITCH/YAW RC channels at their last value"
" and set the throttle channel to its minimum PWM value (low throttle). For "
"those, the only way to setup an RC failsafe is to set the "
":ref:`THR_FS_VALUE<THR_FS_VALUE>` to slightly above that value and use the "
"transmitters trim tab to raise the idle stick value 40-50us above that for "
"normal operation."
msgstr ""
"某些非常老旧的 RC 接收机无法设置为在失去 RC 信号时发送「无脉冲」，只能将 ROLL/PITCH/YAW RC "
"通道保持在最后一个值，并将油门通道设为最小 PWM 值（低油门）。对于这类接收机，设置 RC 失控保护的唯一方法是将 "
":ref:`THR_FS_VALUE<THR_FS_VALUE>` 设置为略高于该值，并使用遥控器微调片将怠速摇杆值提高 40-50us 用于正常操作。"

#: ../../source/docs/apms-failsafe-function.rst:92
#: ca678f2fa4ed4b9380bf2680fcc14e1b
msgid ""
"be sure to do :ref:`ESC calibration<common-esc-calibration>` after you have "
"setup the failsafes and throttle ranges."
msgstr "在完成失控保护和油门范围设置后，请务必执行 :ref:`ESC 校准<common-esc-calibration>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/apms-failsafe-function.rst:94
#: 9466c8433479419c93262fef5735d0a0
msgid "**Transmitter Tutorials:**"
msgstr "**遥控器教程：**"

#: ../../source/docs/apms-failsafe-function.rst:96
#: d6ab523fad6c43b28e1e45fb05ae450c
msgid ""
"`Spektrum Setup <https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/spektrum-dx8-and-"
"ar8000-failsafe-setup>`__"
msgstr ""
"`Spektrum 设置 <https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/spektrum-dx8-and-"
"ar8000-failsafe-setup>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/apms-failsafe-function.rst:100
#: e102ef5cdd164eda810390f1d4fa7c8e
msgid "GCS Failsafe"
msgstr "GCS 失控保护"

#: ../../source/docs/apms-failsafe-function.rst:102
#: 91665ad7df3b482f825a14deae0b93d1
msgid ""
"**How it works.** When flying while using telemetry on the GCS, the "
"autopilot can be programmed to trigger into failsafe mode if it loses "
"telemetry from its primary GCS (set by :ref:`MAV_GCS_SYSID "
"<MAV_GCS_SYSID>`). In the event that the autopilot stops receiving MAVlink "
"(telemetry protocol) heartbeat messages from it, "
":ref:`FS_LONG_ACTN<FS_LONG_ACTN>` applies just as in the case of a long "
"Throttle Failsafe. See :ref:`FS_LONG_ACTN parameter below <failsafe-"
"parameters>` for how each mode responds to the selected action value."
msgstr ""
"**工作原理。** 在使用 GCS 数传飞行时，飞控可被编程为在失去主 GCS（由 :ref:`MAV_GCS_SYSID "
"<MAV_GCS_SYSID>` 设置）的数传链路时触发失控保护模式。若飞控停止接收来自主 GCS 的 MAVLink（数传协议）心跳消息，则应用 "
":ref:`FS_LONG_ACTN<FS_LONG_ACTN>`，与长油门失控保护的情况相同。请参阅下文 :ref:`FS_LONG_ACTN 参数 "
"<failsafe-parameters>`，了解各模式对所选动作值的响应方式。"

#: ../../source/docs/apms-failsafe-function.rst:107
#: b94e878d891a4c72b4b578d1687a5985
msgid "**Setup.**"
msgstr "**设置。**"

#: ../../source/docs/apms-failsafe-function.rst:109
#: 9df4fe12624a432ab4db34383f591166
msgid "Set :ref:`FS_GCS_ENABL<FS_GCS_ENABL>` to 1 to enable it."
msgstr "将 :ref:`FS_GCS_ENABL<FS_GCS_ENABL>` 设为 1 以启用该功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/apms-failsafe-function.rst:110
#: 2e66a5e280b34119929205b9b85090eb
msgid ""
"Connect to the Mission Planner via telemetry. Verify on the bottom right "
"corner of the HUD that you are armed and “flying” in a non auto mode "
"(Manual, Stabilize, FBW are ok). Be sure you have the GCS connected or "
"failsafe will occur immediately, possibly starting the motors!"
msgstr ""
"通过数传连接到 Mission Planner。在 HUD 右下角确认已解锁并处于非自动模式（Manual、Stabilize、FBW "
"均可）「飞行」状态。请确保 GCS 已连接，否则失控保护将立即触发，可能启动电机！"

#: ../../source/docs/apms-failsafe-function.rst:113
#: 1f4f754aec8f491bb30281e57ba4b2ea
msgid ""
"Unplug the telemetry radio getting telemetry from the primary GCS. After a "
"few minutes power off your autopilot. (Remember the autopilot will not go "
"fully into failsafe until :ref:`FS_LONG_TIMEOUT<FS_LONG_TIMEOUT>` seconds of"
" MAVLink inactivity have passed)."
msgstr ""
"拔掉从主 GCS 获取数传的数传电台。几分钟后关闭飞控。（请记住，飞控需要经过 "
":ref:`FS_LONG_TIMEOUT<FS_LONG_TIMEOUT>` 秒的 MAVLink 不活跃后才会完全进入失控保护。）"

#: ../../source/docs/apms-failsafe-function.rst:116
#: 0ec714278559473fa566f32228430cc8
msgid ""
"Connect your autopilot to the mission planner and pull the logs. Verify on "
"the log that the autopilot went into RTL after "
":ref:`FS_LONG_TIMEOUT<FS_LONG_TIMEOUT>` sec of MAVLink inactivity."
msgstr ""
"将飞控连接到 Mission Planner 并查看日志。在日志中确认飞控在 MAVLink 不活跃 "
":ref:`FS_LONG_TIMEOUT<FS_LONG_TIMEOUT>` 秒后进入了 RTL。"

#: ../../source/docs/apms-failsafe-function.rst:120
#: e9b18e5dab4e4f6a85dba3ca0b6b073e
msgid "Configuring for Ground Control Station Control beyond RC range"
msgstr "配置超出 RC 范围时由地面站控制"

#: ../../source/docs/apms-failsafe-function.rst:122
#: 20f77871f95744ec90d3f1b0ae7f97ff
msgid ""
"If the telemetry range exceeds the RC transmitter range, then it may be "
"desired to prevent loss of RC signal from initiating a failsafe. Reliance on"
" the above GCS failsafe would be then be used to provide failsafe "
"protection. In order to prevent the RC system from interfering with GCS "
"operation, set :ref:`THR_FAILSAFE<THR_FAILSAFE>` = 2. This prevents the RC "
"failsafe action from being taken, but still detects the failsafe condition "
"and ignores the RC inputs, preventing possible interference to Ground "
"Control Station control of the vehicle. Control via the RC system can be "
"resumed once back into its range."
msgstr ""
"如果数传范围超过 RC 遥控器范围，则可能需要防止 RC 信号丢失触发失控保护，改用上述 GCS 失控保护提供保护。为防止 RC 系统干扰 GCS "
"操作，将 :ref:`THR_FAILSAFE<THR_FAILSAFE>` = 2。这将阻止执行 RC 失控保护动作，但仍然检测失控保护状态并忽略 "
"RC 输入，防止对 GCS 控制飞行器造成干扰。一旦回到 RC 范围内，可恢复 RC 系统控制。"

#: ../../source/docs/apms-failsafe-function.rst:125
#: 3a0f4ffb1fe54a0f817b206d0dbcd185
msgid "Configuring for valid RC outputs while in RC Failsafe"
msgstr "在 RC 失控保护期间配置有效的 RC 输出"

#: ../../source/docs/apms-failsafe-function.rst:127
#: a95cfa34fb804d4f86be7fd8a60b15d7
msgid ""
"Normally, the RC channels are ignored when in RC Failsafe (except the "
"throttle channel, but for failsafe detection exit only). Sometimes it is "
"desirable to allow the preset signal loss values( for receivers capable of "
"this ), to be used in the event of an RC failsafe. For example, parachute "
"activation, or other controls via RC passthrough (see :ref:`common-"
"auxiliary-functions`) could be desired when in RC failsafe. For receivers "
"with this capability and which use a FS data bit, setting "
":ref:`RC_OPTIONS<RC_OPTIONS>` bit 2 to \"1\", can accomplish this. In this "
"case, the FS bit is ignored. Upon RC signal loss the receiver would go to "
"its pre-set channel outputs values, but a failsafe action would not be taken"
" by ArduPilot, since the receiver is still outputting valid data as far as "
"ArduPilot can detect. The fixed RC channel values would processed as normal "
"by ArduPilot."
msgstr ""
"通常，处于 RC 失控保护时 RC "
"通道会被忽略（油门通道除外，但仅用于检测失控保护退出）。有时需要允许使用预设信号丢失值（适用于支持此功能的接收机），以便在 RC "
"失控保护时使用。例如，在 RC 失控保护时可能需要激活降落伞或通过 RC 直通（请参阅 :ref:`common-auxiliary-"
"functions`）控制其他设备。对于支持此功能且使用 FS 数据位的接收机，将 :ref:`RC_OPTIONS<RC_OPTIONS>` 的第 2"
" 位设置为「1」可实现此目的。此时 FS 位被忽略。RC 信号丢失后，接收机将输出预设通道值，但 ArduPilot "
"不会采取失控保护动作，因为接收机仍在输出 ArduPilot 可检测到的有效数据。固定的 RC 通道值将由 ArduPilot 正常处理。"

#: ../../source/docs/apms-failsafe-function.rst:130
#: cafdf0b3a99d48b1aa5e654ced198cf9
msgid ""
"In this setup, it is usually necessary to make sure that the flight mode "
"channel will force an RTL or AUTO mission to return the vehicle when the "
"receiver loses RC signal, since no failsafe action will be taken, otherwise."
" The values of the flight control channels for Roll, Pitch, Yaw and Throttle"
" need to be appropriately set also (usually neutral positions)."
msgstr ""
"在此设置中，通常需要确保飞行模式通道在接收机失去 RC 信号时会强制进入 RTL 或 AUTO "
"任务以返回飞行器，否则不会采取任何失控保护动作。横滚、俯仰、偏航和油门飞行控制通道的值也需要适当设置（通常为中立位置）。"

#: ../../source/docs/apms-failsafe-function.rst:132
#: f0f40e41b3a24729afb5416856a00032
msgid ""
"Since the autopilot cannot know if the RC link is lost in this "
"configuration, it is possible to get into dangerous situations, especially "
"with QuadPlanes. For example, you are low on battery and far away, and the "
"battery failsafe is active and attempting a VTOL land to prevent a crash. As"
" it drops out of RC range, it will switch to the RC failsafe mode set in the"
" receiver, and attempt to execute that, canceling the battery failsafe "
"action, and ultimately resulting in a crash."
msgstr ""
"由于飞控在此配置下无法知道 RC 链路是否丢失，因此可能陷入危险情况，尤其是在 QuadPlane "
"中。例如，电池电量不足且距离较远，电池失控保护正在激活并尝试 VTOL 降落以防止坠机。当飞出 RC 范围时，将切换到接收机设定的 RC "
"失控保护模式，并尝试执行该模式，从而取消电池失控保护动作，最终导致坠机。"

#: ../../source/docs/apms-failsafe-function.rst:137
#: 56c5ab249e394061b6ccda183f8e960e
msgid "Battery Failsafe"
msgstr "电池失控保护"

#: ../../source/docs/apms-failsafe-function.rst:141
#: 86f3384fffdf4730b849c9660a8d0a11
msgid ""
"This failsafe requires the vehicle have a working :ref:`Power Module "
"<common-powermodule-landingpage>`."
msgstr "此失控保护要求飞行器安装有可用的 :ref:`电源模块 <common-powermodule-landingpage>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/apms-failsafe-function.rst:143
#: fa2811fcedee4e22864a008abb0d53d7
msgid ""
"ArduPilot supports up to 10 batteries/power monitors. All the  discussion "
"below applies to those optional batteries also. Each can trigger a failsafe "
"and each can have different actions and setup values. In addition, a group "
"of batteries can be treated as a single unit, see ``BATTx_MONITOR`` = 10."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 最多支持 10 "
"块电池/电源监测器。以下所有讨论也适用于这些可选电池。每块电池均可触发失控保护，每块都可有不同的动作和设置值。此外，一组电池可作为单个单元处理，请参阅 "
"``BATTx_MONITOR`` = 10。"

#: ../../source/docs/apms-failsafe-function.rst:145
#: 2e96369be3014015b1b71c896ab043d9
msgid ""
"the battery low failsafe voltage must be higher than the battery critical "
"failsafe voltage or a pre-arm error will occur."
msgstr "电池低压失控保护电压必须高于电池临界失控保护电压，否则将出现解锁前错误。"

#: ../../source/docs/apms-failsafe-function.rst:149
#: d7af7c940ca64dbdb7b469aae68c5672
msgid "When the failsafe will trigger"
msgstr "失控保护何时触发"

#: ../../source/docs/apms-failsafe-function.rst:151
#: 7ee62db2d2254af8b83e375a796d7085
msgid ""
"If enabled and set-up correctly the battery failsafe will trigger if the "
"main battery's"
msgstr "若已启用并正确设置，当主电池满足以下条件时将触发电池失控保护"

#: ../../source/docs/apms-failsafe-function.rst:153
#: bf8e5e2b71df44c5a0f3f960bdd6fa02
msgid ""
"voltage drops below the voltage held in the :ref:`BATT_LOW_VOLT "
"<BATT_LOW_VOLT>` parameter (or FS_BATT_VOLTAGE in older versions) for more "
"than 10 seconds. If set to zero (the Plane default value) the voltage based "
"trigger will be disabled."
msgstr ""
"电压低于 :ref:`BATT_LOW_VOLT <BATT_LOW_VOLT>` 参数（旧版本中为 FS_BATT_VOLTAGE）中设置的值超过 "
"10 秒。若设为零（Plane 默认值），则禁用基于电压的触发。"

#: ../../source/docs/apms-failsafe-function.rst:154
#: 4f0d11251e65495f897dcb74f0751758
#, python-format
msgid ""
"remaining capacity falls below the :ref:`BATT_LOW_MAH <BATT_LOW_MAH>` "
"parameter (or FS_BATT_MAH in older versions) 20% of the battery's full "
"capacity is a good choice (i.e. \"1000\" for a 5000mAh battery).  If set to "
"zero the capacity based trigger will be disabled (i.e. only voltage will be "
"used)"
msgstr ""
"剩余容量低于 :ref:`BATT_LOW_MAH <BATT_LOW_MAH>` 参数（旧版本中为 FS_BATT_MAH），电池满容量的 20% "
"是一个不错的选择（即 5000mAh 电池设为「1000」）。若设为零，则禁用基于容量的触发（即仅使用电压）"

#: ../../source/docs/apms-failsafe-function.rst:157
#: 37af14b354c44e6eacc9c2dcbaf5b288
msgid "What will happen"
msgstr "将发生什么"

#: ../../source/docs/apms-failsafe-function.rst:159
#: fe1a3a17c4a54e209b36642f5365fcb0
msgid "When the failsafe is triggered:"
msgstr "当失控保护触发时："

#: ../../source/docs/apms-failsafe-function.rst:161
#: 2e4e015dcac8498e80c11e3b1562feaa
msgid "Buzzer will play a loud low-battery alarm"
msgstr "蜂鸣器将发出响亮的低电量警报"

#: ../../source/docs/apms-failsafe-function.rst:162
#: f0ca042159694e6dafca2102d6c4feaa
msgid "LEDs will flash yellow"
msgstr "LED 将闪烁黄色"

#: ../../source/docs/apms-failsafe-function.rst:163
#: 5f31d6314e04467ab15eac6fd2457ecb
msgid ""
"A warning message will be displayed on the ground station's HUD (if "
"telemetry is connected)"
msgstr "地面站 HUD 上将显示警告消息（若数传已连接）"

#: ../../source/docs/apms-failsafe-function.rst:164
#: 4e2308cf09504501a3fe18b4ec274d39
msgid ":ref:`BATT_FS_LOW_ACT<BATT_FS_LOW_ACT>`  will be executed"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_FS_LOW_ACT<BATT_FS_LOW_ACT>` 将被执行"

#: ../../source/docs/apms-failsafe-function.rst:167
#: 8e1300f7d9cf4d20b97fe8f0e842e32b
msgid "Two-Stage Battery Failsafe"
msgstr "两级电池失控保护"

#: ../../source/docs/apms-failsafe-function.rst:169
#: ec5d40c065564121ad4942d43a293b4c
msgid ""
"Plane includes a two-layer battery failsafe.  This allows setting up a "
"follow-up action if the battery voltage or remaining capacity falls below an"
" even lower threshold."
msgstr "Plane 包含两级电池失控保护。这允许在电池电压或剩余容量降至更低阈值时设置后续动作。"

#: ../../source/docs/apms-failsafe-function.rst:171
#: f4e518e9c1af452d8e3d2a47eaed4ff3
msgid ""
":ref:`BATT_CRT_VOLT <BATT_CRT_VOLT>` - holds the secondary (lower) voltage "
"threshold.  Set to zero to disable. Default is zero."
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_CRT_VOLT <BATT_CRT_VOLT>` - 设置二级（较低）电压阈值。设为零则禁用。默认值为零。"

#: ../../source/docs/apms-failsafe-function.rst:172
#: 8c7868f33e48451598c578233f906110
msgid ""
":ref:`BATT_CRT_MAH <BATT_CRT_MAH>` - holds the secondary (lower) capacity "
"threshold.  Set to zero to disable. Default is zero."
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_CRT_MAH <BATT_CRT_MAH>` - 设置二级（较低）容量阈值。设为零则禁用。默认值为零。"

#: ../../source/docs/apms-failsafe-function.rst:173
#: 71355eb678524233bfd8d7c21771641f
msgid ""
":ref:`BATT_FS_CRT_ACT <BATT_FS_CRT_ACT>` - holds the secondary action to "
"take.  A reasonable setup would be to have :ref:`BATT_FS_LOW_ACT "
"<BATT_FS_LOW_ACT>` = 2 (RTL) and :ref:`BATT_FS_CRT_ACT <BATT_FS_CRT_ACT>` = "
"1 (Land)"
msgstr ""
":ref:`BATT_FS_CRT_ACT <BATT_FS_CRT_ACT>` - 设置二级动作。合理设置为 "
":ref:`BATT_FS_LOW_ACT <BATT_FS_LOW_ACT>` = 2（RTL），:ref:`BATT_FS_CRT_ACT "
"<BATT_FS_CRT_ACT>` = 1（Land）"

#: ../../source/docs/apms-failsafe-function.rst:176
#: 37bfd5baef8947699c42b58767ee6f30
msgid "Advanced Battery Failsafe Settings"
msgstr "高级电池失控保护设置"

#: ../../source/docs/apms-failsafe-function.rst:178
#: 764f65bd550c42dfb800173f6cd31cb8
msgid ""
":ref:`BATT_FS_VOLTSRC <BATT_FS_VOLTSRC>` allows configuring whether the raw "
"battery voltage or a sag corrected voltage is used"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_FS_VOLTSRC <BATT_FS_VOLTSRC>` 允许配置使用原始电池电压还是下垂校正后的电压"

#: ../../source/docs/apms-failsafe-function.rst:179
#: 63b1da2be86447229ebb2782bd176f84
msgid ""
":ref:`BATT_LOW_TIMER <BATT_LOW_TIMER>` can configure how long the voltage "
"must be below the threshold for the failsafe to trigger"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_LOW_TIMER <BATT_LOW_TIMER>` 可配置电压低于阈值多长时间后触发失控保护"

#: ../../source/docs/apms-failsafe-function.rst:180
#: 0a6d0b0da672415a80948f19b1ebbe8e
msgid ""
"``BATTx_`` parameters can be setup to trigger the failsafe on other "
"batteries"
msgstr "``BATTx_`` 参数可设置为对其他电池触发失控保护"

#: ../../source/docs/apms-failsafe-function.rst:183
#: 1efc8132a59949bbafea9564da64ab65
msgid "Battery Failsafe Actions"
msgstr "电池失控保护动作"

#: ../../source/docs/apms-failsafe-function.rst:185
#: d94f33d362184bb8991ca727ea7b9e9a
msgid ""
"The following is a description of the actions that can be taken for battery "
"failsafes:"
msgstr "以下是电池失控保护可采取的动作说明："

#: ../../source/docs/apms-failsafe-function.rst:188
#: c7ea4d43b2184ef0acd813a1464379ae
